- Validity must reflect the actual issuing organization's policy.
- Fees must be geographically appropriate.
- Fees may differ by examination center.
- Currency must be visible.
- Show when the fee was last verified.
- Clearly mark estimates.
- Never present outdated prices as current verified prices.

If information cannot be verified, display:

